{
  "locale": "en",
  "family": "connective",
  "templates": [
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-famine.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "In the shadow of the famine, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:59c3a57121aa576946e545cd1223a6c1901590affb8d367f414a0cdeaab046f4"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-famine.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "While every bite of food had to be carefully rationed,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:56d83894e0237c1ec4bcde9bf478916c33d1f1e78fb33824b07fd15e4c645968"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-famine.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "As the storage bins grew emptier by the day,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:16b0f597132db6573cadec10b189e512c858ab26ff8d2d84e66cf8f12f440a2c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-famine.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "In the days when the next meal was still uncertain,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:062206334ca34ed4fa55756579580ffadf4c77969f8e59739a5221270f2c5ac8"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-famine.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When hunger became a worry shared by everyone,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0870c9458505563aa71759a6de9809d84d4111ae49be30d094d36ed70c86057b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-famine.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "While the colony held on and waited for a new food supply,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:73672a6e37772e8660d0118cc898089c0a4d41bdbbca56fade781e498952f66a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-wrath.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "In those days of unspent anger, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:38f518b099ffd52c39b3f41a172babe42ab1356f5a9eb344846b48eb38579a08"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-wrath.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "While everyone still resented what had happened,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d76b52ee8a657ae4f05950e96dd344e0ac5f6b7ec2737f345465e35458d456f2"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-wrath.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "While hostility in the colony had yet to subside,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6351c3f241e28cc96ffc01c1af3c2a0b68588f49d8ae286ecd0eb55b496a39b8"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-wrath.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "During the period when blame and avoidance became routine,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2a1edb3fa415c3181b6cb629775692410575eb3d09d88a01842f22267ea79540"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-wrath.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "While the colony's anger still shaped every interaction,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f3210eaef6c83f81a92912e1344469d429e408af3bf7c4bad5b0fe0239805ee1"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.era-wrath.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "In the days when everyone carefully avoided sensitive subjects,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:92683b0ca0ed6f2b993787cfa5fb8634e780da6a6a9b81050d78ddffbdaada0f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-again.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Once again, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7517611299ece1090d15dbd525734f3a00082ead8c892a3e475b7511885b7348"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-again.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Before long,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2e80c511770b29ffd3fa5402bfd331abb333429ec9ad37a9959300d2dde5a9d8"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-again.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When the same thing happened again,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5470e864b235c6cf96141e41131b506b09c4c2af738692b5fd7dfa5d05dfdd4b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-again.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After a short interval,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f5f85a43851931d87cf935dda5d8bbc60f3af5d329e9e2687f2ab097a14eb169"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-again.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "As if returning to a familiar rhythm,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:83f2cad477dcad85284544dd8d5e70f5e4f6b8c5084ae25abc2fa19ae3cbc312"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-again.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "This was not the first time,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d98745f65025b8775a12cdbb985b3bbf06c098c598f34e19bf88856d3e96029c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-many.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "For the {count}th time, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fc68c08850bcdba12a31fecd7ea3eae4980bb065fb74eb0cdaf92fb6b4b2bdc9"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-many.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Including this occasion, the same thing had happened {count} times,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:256c63f6055a4be076628a56dbddf26d8bcb9267e948e766abacd7d1bcf4be54"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-many.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "By the {count}th occurrence,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dd8ff7298549883fafad354813603e07644e180847b6e46f5b507531d4eb06cd"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-many.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When this situation appeared for the {count}th time,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0b4302053f6af9179a620efe0d13537466f3dedb3dedb85b954f34462cfa7dba"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-many.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After experiencing this {count} times,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:eed0969e0ddfc8b3302447f29b555628718bf4959f0c081eac6b2b8af730cdab"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.recur-many.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "That day brought the {count}th entry in the record,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a23dfbc8578cef84e80a5dd907078ee145788d4717a801222d81ccd7c869bb4c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-apology.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After that argument, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:51e3aa46e912328fbdfafb3885f55aa8cc3ac82facec41eab9499df2e102121c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-apology.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Once both sides had calmed down,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:92c4821d17986e879ca535fee0397b435d86708f5bd5fee0b5cd0c4280715d47"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-apology.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "While the awkwardness left by the argument still lingered,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a50467d7f4991d795effa05ee531cef57989c4fce5f7f33309a8d918e72a3cfe"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-apology.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Remembering the harsh words from last time,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e6619e6c110557893e07eb8b8e8606401a879e65eacf632d58a0994950a70d3d"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-apology.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After the conflict had passed,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b6ad8290f6905f3d5658907ef4e8fcabccb7cc3fc41a710d1920f5013c246e52"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-apology.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "To keep the dispute from becoming a lasting grievance,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0c28fe288c10e5bf59589e988f68e8aea6d8f6a8fd1ad3ea7f93d59a1fe73414"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-brawl.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "That quarrel could not be contained, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:70c1e40adfcb36a0aa7723335ea14c777f42cb5dd801d76b9816551faea0a13b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-brawl.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "As voices grew harsher,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f59abe457c389ac431ac566e4251750e3e10aca0dd84508cb3f56fb5c81cfd7e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-brawl.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "With neither side willing to step back,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:355212e0144971d87463e80380bffacce6e9e7d2bf94c0310834fa6ef0d7cfbc"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-brawl.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "As the dispute crossed beyond words,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f91254b9067c0d4a900b4fb2f78d949cb0998f17dc68493b91c311b9a7115474"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-brawl.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When emotion finally overwhelmed reason,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7a47aee289e05e4d35b53580f6f0d6107123db8c96f0242c389c916abe566f30"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-brawl.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After the last trace of restraint disappeared,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c5922397f8efe0d07c75e21a2c24b9f00cdbe5404ba7035d9f266b1e645a0ddd"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-breakup.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The rift never healed, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:4316487e133ebcbc9a3ee258880c7d2445984ff5007c361a03d064d2f0b8faf1"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-breakup.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When long-accumulated disappointment finally reached its limit,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3d8724dfca8d6d6879d3be5dfaa68d98711882ff0b4b77a9d6825d8fce9dbf8b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-breakup.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After attempts to repair the relationship still led nowhere,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:eb4d5a4c7cf6150389ede3884fec9e94292458a27c716beeb068634300670b57"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-breakup.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Once both realized there was no returning to how things were,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2b8b82b51275d6acd4061b170ccfa6c3dc2675d442fb77068a8fd6058d45788d"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-breakup.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "As the rift continued to widen,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:790cb9ab4113f947a1e21049ea6e4d04f4900462b2ba19c4eec1b325bc3af827"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-breakup.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After the final attempt to save things failed,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2fa24c23d8733999655c10892ea0ae4df39a16c3da1c808e57782e506feb88c6"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-comfort.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After witnessing that breakdown, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:529ce5d3642a108c5e4bbb247818603d3d73fa0a6fbf651d1915ed5b47ffbf1e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-comfort.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "With the sight of that breakdown still impossible to forget,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:cd1cddb8d828ace14ddfb356565b25e089172c31f18f81e5ca9bdba6dc849169"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-comfort.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After making sure the breakdown had passed,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ce0b607355ab54cee75c56e687bf33ee3f6d4f050acf09368265e49a652ed4c2"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-comfort.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When that person most needed company,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e024765a5c7f23c7be0147a7e0ec76d1851a536708f5335acb4c8e83672efc08"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-comfort.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "As shock gradually turned into concern,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6f48a8f1a5033c504d84cc78b1d0f25d28269e15492ad6ae976ffaa4273dbaa9"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-comfort.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "So that the pain would not have to be carried alone,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d84dbe706d33277e306e0c8852cb238aca1438d32c65a3625c8e83bab746df78"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-confession-after-fail.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The last rejection did not stop {actor}, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:88952062b983e6c6ef9bd66e9cb96d6c2335720e589780595edd5da65837345c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-confession-after-fail.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After {actor} received no answer last time,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3fb3c768f7c331650c263184fe35870d88d1d48acc92e9056bdbaa382a2417cd"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-confession-after-fail.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After {actor:possessive} failed attempt,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:59182142607632b339d62966594df74be120ab195d7a67cac9df6f992fa8da2d"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-confession-after-fail.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The rejection left {actor} quiet for a while, but eventually,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8500c1f08b1b3ba5b37792de752217add382b3e7fc41b93e3bbb717e9fd9df9d"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-confession-after-fail.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When {actor} stopped treating the first setback as the end,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a16e70a4a54b4f95b018ebf63c1527d21e95dfe1eec3409e1ccc2d8fb6bb0ba7"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-confession-after-fail.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After {actor} reconsidered what was said last time,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b89bdc4f057645362724a611ba61df5e6b7e1f7fd7df88f26af5f0e25c8fd31f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-reconcile.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After all these days of silence, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:def7d7d89dbb18f995970ba34c4d5685309ae8fa25023f04c3b56deb41f65ffa"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-reconcile.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When silence became harder to bear than the argument,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c57955ed75fb7382693ac30c134df02a5f29193774f2155b9f1854e43677030c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-reconcile.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Once the first anger had slowly receded,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bc9df489a1ca7ff2d45f2555d8c46345711b21cf4fc47d9572172f0b3aea78e3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-reconcile.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After time apart allowed both sides to reconsider,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6a8aa173b741266ad686f8bc469d1eb8a85fafb3119202c4d26fe6bd2725a17c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-reconcile.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "To end the long period of distance,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f2ae30c8f31109c369017f687d4d82ae9c6ace95a3769a63d5be909311dfbefc"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-reconcile.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When both were finally willing to speak again,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6d9cc6353c76a8784f72fb64950fb265427a1c317c1cb63a60a83d406796a59b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rekindle.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After the time apart, they still could not let each other go, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b7d78b5dd7154b05584c221b3a25459cc8a563820796d4994d606cd410b0790e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rekindle.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Time apart had not diminished the old feelings,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:800a4fc0159e67bc7eee6427c1e32299aefa8b4b6d762d8ca259c00c0a8a5199"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rekindle.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When they faced each other again, the familiar attachment returned,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bb83df22b8465b309b36b7ad6c935303fe21c8ca07a4474f1cb7a92b5e8bb5dd"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rekindle.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After the relationship ended, neither could truly let go,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:77e05914593a122a9711a96e50035799f14b5ff9da34a8dd87b50759adbcb0f2"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rekindle.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After a long detour, they still returned to each other,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b3b797eb8d15c7d1a0ffe32c8fff3f96bc65ade5d99c57a21ff144b1b95eb358"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rekindle.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When the old understanding emerged again,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:90bdd1a3aac05a24398f35bfc3fd349eaddc13a481cb5b70b60a46c353bd671f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rival.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Resentment had been building for a long time, ",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f2c70e88f1fc19bd8a7054942baa39d7dfd295bdeab2aacacf7e45bf77cf0da2"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rival.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Repeated conflicts kept pushing the two farther apart,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e0528030dd04c231ff4d6ef159113381af03f377b8648f5ed75e580a4472f7c5"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rival.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "As competition gradually turned into hostility,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5f8d7c40bcc9cc9fbf506009b1d45666a5a1245fb85f3ed61935d9d4ba42c90d"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rival.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "With neither willing to end the contest,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:93cfa88e447f8c0c4b2fd0ec7784fdb9acbe7efbb693a6381fd06739411c118f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rival.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "As earlier conflicts remained unresolved,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a3c7e7268ea9d75e6055f1d10336b9421b60e3bf64d79d038dc8461643028bf3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.lead.seq-rival.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When mutual resentment finally became open opposition,",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:501d730d37dc02358e76678ecbdb0d7a58bfccbf0e7126983b0479668539d48b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-1.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} kept finding each other to talk that day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:151d25fcc82b05d1bd5edc2f7436ffc4377bd44deb5f28b761c4ff6f3770810f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-1.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} talked several times that day and found a new subject every time.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9570a251541e23eb336cee96f649d15e8dc6b6a9da34536a8eb896595b5a95a3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-1.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} repeatedly found each other, filling the day with bits of conversation.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:28ef7b4d74e20182aaa220d5a67e5bced9bf2d355698f2508e257f31541e3916"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-1.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Every time {a} and {b} met that day, they stopped to talk and got along especially well.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:656bc90545dd6c17d9a39cbef1f5cc8e9966cf5ee5416e9155ff73b6f0c25758"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-1.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} always had something to say that day, with one brief meeting following another.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9ba54656f428608f56c61b2edd1c8712f5bbb9c3d9230e30a2bf95e982fcf60b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-1.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "From work through rest, {a} and {b} kept their conversation going throughout the day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:50ce03c958d759f504726ef0e7bb9919824525d8d7d7d594c81d7520ff74cfe3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-2.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} had no end of things to say that day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7c6af5dbb6ec013be837d6f5aa05e501dde12aa6a4fabe0da59d5a0fa49d0e82"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-2.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "One subject followed another for {a} and {b}, leaving scarcely a quiet moment that day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fc1b53653f6f5b9de71301e1b6f49286674dbbf85242cc791b25f4448fcb91d7"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-2.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} moved from daily matters to personal concerns and talked longer than either noticed.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:64ecdacd370ad1a300cf1c9a14409eafa38c730357bb9d5bca209b0bf4311a39"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-2.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "That day, {a} and {b} seemed to say everything they had been saving up.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d0bef9ff4373d6aaf9170c6cb3f727966d24f7e94c07b50505cc9b47133cb8e7"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-2.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Starting from one small subject, {a} and {b} talked until they forgot it was time to rest.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ff58b627d0ff47a7b9e9b0eb4da1db4f938154f5879d22ba32de1566a938ce11"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-chat-2.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} spent the day absorbed in conversation and barely noticed the noise around them.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:96569c2a1619ece5308d3f084e2117e8509a9b976f4baccad0d319666529e312"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-greet-1.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} kept crossing paths that day, and grew familiar.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:08190f833fb51539581e6ef038086f80502e933df2817a135688afb44477584a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-greet-1.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} crossed paths several times that day, and each greeting felt more natural than the last.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:88787ffa648c830cbd058a18cfdda17f2b4d36d3ba61a881366dfddab135b54a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-greet-1.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Repeated encounters through the day helped {a} and {b} learn each other's habits.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:19696132e301b0b9eb7f1a999b771215bfc735e29e4f067b369f42e8b221102b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-greet-1.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} greeted each other whenever they passed, and the unfamiliarity quickly faded.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:27210bdc91ccd1d4503f09bd04d0972952c4e3049d1b2b6fe7456b2cdb090f28"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-greet-1.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Several chance meetings that day made {a} and {b} more familiar than simple nodding acquaintances.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f29c102a394a0cb2ee5159635b2d9aa8a69fbb67d6c185655f28f73c48098bb3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-greet-1.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} kept meeting around the colony, and their exchanged greetings brought them closer.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2109a3eb587679643f322477d6923f755c02282e0c486c54d238281c550b0415"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-meal-1.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} shared several meals that day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5487e3c6e1dd8fa87958a4250d4f7432f44d7c2858ac14c9954d56b680ff586a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-meal-1.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} shared a table more than once that day and gradually fell into an easy rhythm.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ec127f0b96365b83084b6df06a31d4f323473a70870465e366cf204f8c48663c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-meal-1.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "From the first meal to the last, {a} and {b} kept sitting together that day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:869aa73d3699ccfa6f4959f03a471cba7b5a27c77e09e0abde0368cb64e74252"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-meal-1.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} met over several meals and naturally shared what had happened during the day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0df4dcb89ee71cbcc6f93b349054141b30ee129cd71d272a3bc34233707e859c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-meal-1.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "At mealtimes that day, {a} and {b} could usually be found at the same table.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a9c6a1dcba6227b6517207fb1f9f8b811579e7cb51192194bb819a30b2557e53"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-meal-1.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} continued talking through meal after meal, making the relationship feel more natural.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7e4ddeb5ffa715cfd3dc57fd0128373617ebf62be515b5d937a14bc445f0a38b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-socialize-1.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} spent every spare moment together that day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:84cb50e7fbd3e2e984f620765d04b1bc4974892bc0d19b5c0fbafdcaba153ae0"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-socialize-1.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} spent several breaks together that day and thoroughly enjoyed themselves.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a6311100b2adf7ad5add3d246fc68637abe2d88e3116580f2f59eaf8d476ee33"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-socialize-1.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Whenever there was a spare moment, {a} and {b} found each other and made their own fun.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7332eb6dce22789d8d7899bbc1534b0c3cb1c5ab8a8b3903a6502a8b38767d38"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-socialize-1.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} moved from one pastime to another, making the day's rest especially lively.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:485fa3b756ff90e06361b3fb627fe8ea6c6a238a1e488082327da95013f0ad2f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-socialize-1.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "During the day's free time, {a} and {b} kept appearing together, with laughter never far away.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:60c723b9bff125ceaf13e2cc1a5fed7a3c498b27220d72b38eadfb767166c3c1"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.merge.merge-socialize-1.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} turned several short breaks into time for games together.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c7a7f1dcc508409decc8802bcec27f51c25888d89da289f53d0e9f13a94fb6cd"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-1.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": " The air in the colony hung heavy for days.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7c9e97642255f31907789f1d57986dd44ce0221616db9425b44ecc6af37aeb26"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-1.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "For the next few days, everyone spoke more quietly than usual.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3346a65ec73efcc9c06b92c70dcb712f794c5180bd5d485c5408301afa808b61"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-1.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The weight left by the event did not lift for a long time.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:703d3410d361e37584af9632c1168cbbea1c1d79ef963fc813789ace4ff02033"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-1.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The colony briefly lost its usual liveliness, and even rest periods stayed quiet.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0f7153ca4d413b49b63925d3890722b436f99ccde83dd73f2d4a2785e885e944"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-1.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Everyone tried not to mention the event again, but the mood remained oppressive.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:90c47f86d99e24a5fe26f2756225f840856902a1f49c6fa85901f14381df9fb7"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-1.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Even ordinary work was affected, with unease lingering all around.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7426b7117e2bdb9fd98f9c06abd84bea050e03469c3e1dcc67b0118afaee5f49"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-2.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": " Everyone saw it, and no one felt good about it.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:917e39a335a495f9e7f7c7877dbb26d99541e97e388ce28296957636b91d683c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-2.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Those who witnessed it became much quieter and did not know what to say.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:67a869dcb95ae32995a3381bc97490d6763cfdeee5f75bc6db3c7ce4866914d2"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-2.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The event left an uncomfortable place in everyone's thoughts.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c34d9ad45771c5307c4e3a25f4f69561e10197a25db2e78e3d389f039a4dbb3a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-2.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "No one wanted to turn it into gossip, and silence became the shared response.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bf53b0b41b3bd700392b1b2a97bd8141ae3fecb2bd445004ccf2ef8e258ef0e2"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-2.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Those who were present still recalled the scene afterward, and their mood fell with it.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:530882980d86317bae7b48a96b99b0dde7d68d9a7882f6eb2e970ef517f7a2b1"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-bad-2.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Although everyone returned to work, they all carried the same heaviness.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1f2582b3720c30ac6e1446b5f5b0e6afa531b6a31b6989cd727436427b4471ea"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-1.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": " Word spread quickly; everyone was talking about them.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dbc6562066bda5a129383b3961b3aa26a8ecfb4dcf330f99b0ce69677295d77e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-1.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The good news took little time to spread throughout the colony.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:337d70d160b943345b25c063385f2007762cde5e7b22a2decf7b5388f44840a3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-1.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Everyone who heard about it wanted to ask more, and the conversation quickly grew lively.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8cc2ef2d8f4c1e8fd3d3b30bf4b7e6c3c9c5a0a101602253ad20ea29332763a9"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-1.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "From workplaces to dining tables, people mentioned the event with smiles.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5b769c9e720ac20d36b8639a81774fa0aaf7028141c713131f5f90b403225451"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-1.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The event became everyone's newest shared subject, with fresh details each time it came up.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f56fce1e92a5ab3945eaff21692b8fe3fadf8de895f48fedf8f42185e2a11b87"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-1.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Once the news spread, even those who were absent learned what had happened.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:02d154c71d8e9c26a67e67f0ba6e29cb306a78c0bd22707f7bae6ea49ccd553b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-2.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": " The whole colony was happy for them.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ef052a264b65dbb98e73b3167015ad194cb0d5beac26d2824ec57791feb0485c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-2.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Good wishes arrived again and again, making the happiness feel more real.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7556befb7b2a09c00d3d3844ff47531ab921497fb0045ccd120e74036421bf03"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-2.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The outcome brought a rare spell of easy laughter to the colony.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e797ec693358f828752c4d405fe32eb9880f84984cc86437afe7fd1f31b4162e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-2.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Everyone who heard the news offered sincere congratulations, and the happiness quickly spread.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6aece0eeaa0026293096fb691b0710e5f9e9fe8df6e161316c0da4be15bf79b3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-2.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The good event made everyday life in the colony feel a little brighter.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fe649d93e998d0b1db17309980b065f6c1139506df9550e16a1903b1d4c81ef4"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.connective.tail.react-good-2.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Everyone made time to share the happiness, and the mood stayed warm for a long while.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d0ea7bc2159ad8e39d2410fb030eab6e858cf02c04c3779a3fde97869be2e515"
    }
  ]
}
